ird actor  from hbo's deadwood to appear this  season following timothy olyphant and w  earl brown  bokutan doesn't get any information out  of him before he takes his own life  but she does allude to some kind of  shared history between herself and  gideon  asking the officer to take her to him  without actually naming him  hopefully the show will expand more on  how the weapon slipped from her hands  into gideon's at some point after her  rebels cameo  after successfully hijacking an imperial  gozanti cruiser ship a model first  spotted in the phantom menace  mano departs to continue his mission of  delivering the child to its people  but not before asking his fellow  mandalorian where he can find the jedi  she claimed to know  grateful for his aid bogatan tells him  to travel to the city of kaladan on the  forest planet of corvus  a new location for the star wars  universe so who is this  jedi on corvus another animated favorite  ahsoka tano the debut of anakin  skywalker's former padawan and live  action has been a long time coming with  speculation over rosario dawson's  casting as ahsoka running rampant for  months  and the circumstances surrounding her  imminent arrival couldn't be more  satisfying for die hard star wars fans  you should have seen him in person  anakin skywalker  he was my master having initially  squared off his enemies bokutan and  ahsoka  allied during the siege of mandalore as  detailed on clone wars seventh season  once the jedi order disbanded and order  66 went into full effect leading ahsoka  to go into hiding the status of their  coalition grew murky  but it seems that they retained some  method of contact throughout the  galactic civil war and in the midst of  the empire's collapse  also much like boca tan ahsoka's  adventures continued through rebels  where she took up the code name fulcrum  and became a secret rebel operative  her vape beyond the series finale was a  mystery for a long time but it's likely  the mandalorian's 12th 